e were removed and the open ground put in their place; a block added north of the museum on the avenue. Still guessed: which building in the strip is the museum (the outlines carry no names or heights), the colour, the height (about 27 m), the window rhythm, the depth; the Marmara Pera's tower falls just beyond the plate; the hill's fall is not modelled."}